{"id":"delante","lemma":"delante","pos":"adv","rank":639,"glosses":["in front of, before (spatially)","forward, forwards (with hacia preceding it)","ahead (with por preceding it)"],"ipa":"/deˈlante/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-delante.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué puedes ver allí delante?","en":"What can you see up ahead?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300056","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Tenemos un jardín delante de nuestra casa.","en":"We have a garden in front of our house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611690","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"garden"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"Tengo un largo camino por delante.","en":"I've got a long way to go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611795","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"way, route"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"El autobús para delante de mi casa.","en":"The bus stops in front of my house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687426","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"bus, coach"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"¿Qué ha pasado ahí delante?","en":"What's happened up ahead?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422351","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"past"},{"g":"there"},null]}]}